# Cloudflare API Reference

## Auth
- **Global API Key**: `dash.cloudflare.ae/profile/api-keys`
- Email: exact from dashboard
- Headers: `X-Auth-Email` + `X-Auth-Key`

## Test Auth
```bash
curl -s --noproxy '*' "https://api.cloudflare.com/client/v4/user" \
  -H "X-Auth-Email: EMAIL" \
  -H "X-Auth-Key: API_KEY"
```

## Key Endpoints
| Service | Endpoint |
|---------|----------|
| User | `GET /client/v4/user` |
| D1 DB | `POST /client/v4/accounts/{id}/d1/databases` |
| R2 | `POST /client/v4/accounts/{id}/r2/buckets` |
| Workers | `GET /client/v4/accounts/{id}/workers/scripts` |
| Pages | `GET /client/v4/accounts/{id}/pages/projects` |

## Create D1
```bash
curl -s -X POST "https://api.cloudflare.com/client/v4/accounts/{ID}/d1/databases" \
  -H "X-Auth-Email: {EMAIL}" -H "X-Auth-Key: {KEY}" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"name": "db-name"}'
```

## Create R2 Bucket
```bash
curl -s -X POST "https://api.cloudflare.com/client/v4/accounts/{ID}/r2/buckets" \
  -H "X-Auth-Email: {EMAIL}" -H "X-Auth-Key: {KEY}" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"name": "bucket-name"}'
```

## Error Codes
| Code | Meaning |
|------|---------|
| 9109 | Invalid token |
| 9100 | Auth failed |
| 10000 | Auth error (account ID mismatch) |
| 7003 | Bad endpoint path |